1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,083
An X sperm makes a daughter.

2
00:00:02,083 --> 00:00:03,945
A Y sperm makes a son.

3
00:00:03,945 --> 00:00:09,752
Fifty fifty, and the deciding chromosome comes only from the father.

4
00:00:09,752 --> 00:00:12,682
So the mother of three daughters failed at nothing.

5
00:00:12,682 --> 00:00:16,367
Blaming her has no biological basis at all.

